 "_provenance": {
  "transcribed_from": "ISO 4026, 4027, 4028 and 4029:2003 Table 1, and the ASME B18.3 hexagon socket set screw table, by hand, one row per size; no value was interpolated",
  "replaces": "the FreeCAD_FastenersWB iso4026def.csv, iso4028def.csv and asmeb18.3.5def.csv values this type was first built from: they disagree with ISO 4026/4027/4029 Table 1 on 9 of 13 length ranges and ISO 4028 on M4, and their inch point diameter is the midpoint of C for every point, dog included",
  "point_diameter_basis": "the table's maximum on both systems: dp max (ISO 4026, 4028), C max (flat) and P max (dog) for ASME B18.3"
 },
